  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds the OnAdPlayClick event (AdPlayClickEventArgs: EventId, Placement), raised on every click-through, so it can fire more than once in one play. The creative is told the real ad-surface size, including XOffset / YOffset and later window resizes, and a warning is logged when a play starts on a surface shorter than the recommended 250 device-independent pixels (the ad still plays). device.w / device.h now report the window's client area in physical pixels. An exception thrown by your initialization handler is no longer reported as an initialization failure. A failed creative download now completes LoadAd with a failure instead of never calling back, and a server Retry-After can no longer cause unbounded retries. Header-bidding creative folders are now cleaned up. Native AOT support and the 7.1.0 dependency floors are unchanged.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "Vungle SDK for WinUI 3",
  "verbatimVersion": "7.1.1",
